{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdtvK8vHw6r4Yr19eVgLP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Plan for Order 7841 Payment Timeout\n\n1. **Call `payments.provider_status()`** immediately to determine if the provider is alive and responsive (non-blocking diagnostic).\n\n2. **Call `payments.get(order_id=7841)`** to check if a payment record exists for this order. This reveals whether the submit call succeeded despite the timeout.\n\n3. **Decision branch:**\n   - **If payment found:** Do NOT resubmit. Confirm the payment to the customer.\n   - **If no payment found AND provider is healthy:** Wait 5–10 seconds, then call `payments.get()` again (the payment may be processing asynchronously).\n   - **If still no payment AND provider is healthy:** Resubmit `payments.submit(order_id=7841, amount_usd=120.00)` with a short retry window and idempotency safeguards.\n   - **If provider is unhealthy:** Hold and retry the full sequence after a backoff delay.\n\n4. **Explicit answer on resubmission:** Yes, resubmit only if `payments.get()` confirms no payment exists after the initial timeout and a brief grace period. The cold-start condition and read-before-write pattern justify this safe retry."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":260,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":289,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}}
